---
import '@fontsource/inter/300.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/400.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/500.css';
import '../styles/global.css';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>about — senja studio</title>
		<style>
			.nav-link { position: relative; text-decoration: none; }
			.nav-link::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 1px; width: 0; height: 1px; background: currentColor; transition: width 0.3s ease; }
			.nav-link:hover::after { width: 100%; }
			.nav-link.active { color: #1c1c1c; }
			.nav-link.active::after { width: 100%; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="fixed top-3 left-6 right-6 z-10 flex flex-row items-start">
			<a href="/" class="block text-[41px] leading-tight font-normal" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #1c1c1c; text-transform: uppercase;">senja studio</a>
		</div>
		<nav class="fixed right-6 z-10 flex flex-row text-[0.76rem] font-[325]" style="top: 17px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #1c1c1c;">
			<a href="/" class="nav-link">projects</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href="/services" class="nav-link">services</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href="/about" class="nav-link active">about</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href="/contact" class="nav-link">contact</a>
		</nav>
		<a href="#" class="fixed right-6 z-10" style="top: 44px;" aria-label="Instagram">
			<svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
				<rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" stroke="#1c1c1c" stroke-width="2" />
				<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5" stroke="#1c1c1c" stroke-width="2" />
				<circle cx="18" cy="6" r="1.3" fill="#1c1c1c" />
			</svg>
		</a>

		<a href="/" class="fixed left-6 z-10 text-2xl font-normal" style="top: 84px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1c1c1c; text-decoration: none;">←</a>


		<main class="min-h-screen px-6 pb-24 pt-28">
			<div class="ml-[29vw] max-w-xl space-y-6 text-justify text-sm font-[325] leading-relaxed" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #1c1c1c;">
				<p><span class="font-medium">Senja Studio</span> creates visual content for hotels, restaurants, concept stores and alternative venues across Southeast Asia and beyond.</p>
				<p>In a world saturated with images, what makes people stop is feeling. The opportunity to lose oneself in another storyline. Every project is built around storytelling first: the texture, the details, the light that carry emotion and leave a mark. Shot across multiple formats, the work holds the grain and depth that polished production cannot replicate, and that audiences instinctively trust.</p>
				<p>All content delivered within 5 business days. Full usage rights included. Ready to post.</p>
				<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
					<p class="text-sm lowercase font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Destinations</p>
					<p>Based in Southeast Asia, available worldwide.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
					<p class="text-sm lowercase font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">My kit</p>
					<p>A mix of professional mobile equipment, drone and vintage digital cameras — chosen for the grain, texture and depth they bring to every shoot.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
